# Native libraries shipped with the standalone (e.g. the macOS arm64 dylibs under
# src/main/native/) must never be EOL- or encoding-normalized, regardless of a
# contributor's core.autocrlf / core.eol settings. Without this, a clone with
# autocrlf=true relies solely on git's content heuristic to leave them untouched.
*.dll   binary
*.dylib binary
*.so    binary
